---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
---
<Base title="Cookie policy" description="The cookies compound. uses and how to control them.">
  <Legal title="Cookie policy" updated="[date]">
    <p>This website uses as few cookies as possible.</p>
    <h2>Strictly necessary</h2>
    <p>Used to run the site and protect forms from spam. These don’t need your consent.</p>
    <h2>Analytics (only with your consent)</h2>
    <p>[If we use Google Analytics 4: these cookies tell us which pages are useful. They are set only if you accept them in the cookie banner.] [If we use Plausible: no analytics cookies are set, and no banner is needed for analytics.]</p>
    <h2>Booking and embedded tools</h2>
    <p>The booking calendar on the Book page is provided by [Cal.com / Calendly] and may set its own cookies when you use it.</p>
    <h2>Changing your mind</h2>
    <p>You can change your choice at any time from the cookie settings link in the footer [to add with the consent banner], or clear cookies in your browser.</p>
  </Legal>
</Base>
